Entities</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsLinkedSpellContainer_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsLinkedSpellContainer (spell flag)\">IsLinkedSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Weapon_Dropped.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Weapon_Dropped!\"> Condition: Weapon Dropped! </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Dropped!_(Condition)\" title=\"Weapon Dropped! (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weapon Dropped!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Weapon_Dropped%21_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Dropped!_(Condition)\" title=\"Weapon Dropped! (Condition)\">Weapon Dropped!</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>An enemy has made you drop your weapon to the ground, similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disarmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Disarmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disarmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Disarmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disarmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Disarmed (Condition)\">Disarmed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command\" title=\"Command\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/60px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_